    "@type": "Rating",
    "ratingValue": "5"
   },
   "reviewBody": "I've been following your website for a very long-time and this is one of my favorite paneer dishes. I love how you post the quantities in grams and that helps to scale the recipes well. We made a large batch to serve 16 people and that turned out wonderful. Will be adding paneer, methi and cream on the day of serving. I'll be making goli baje, mango sheera and tehri. Thank you for the beautiful work.",
